---Attempts to retrieve the value for the specified property from this stylesheet, or if missing, from its parent.
---
---Info: If an entry is missing, the entire parent hierarchy gets checked for that same property until it is found or
---there are no more parents.
---@param property integer Number representing the style property to search for. Can be an arbitrary number but prefer using a property listed in the `ui.StyleValue` table for consistency and safety, as the underlying property IDs may change in the future.
---@return integer? # The value of the specified property, or nil if not found.
function StyleSheet:GetValue(property) end

---Sets the value for the specified property on this stylesheet.
---
---Warning: Currently, changing a property value will not update that stylesheet's users, and instead you must re-assign
---the stylesheet to trigger an update.
---@param property integer Number representing the style property to search for. Can be an arbitrary number but prefer using a property listed in the `ui.StyleValue` table for consistency and safety, as the underlying property IDs may change in the future.
---@param value integer The value to set for that property.
function StyleSheet:SetValue(property, value) end

